            <section ID="LINK_c0dd2b0e-66c6-4fcd-bfa0-75682bbae041">
               <id root="4f089708-91f3-4580-a2bb-1c98277ac47e"/>
               <code code="34067-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE SECTION"/>
               <title>INDICATIONS AND USAGE</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Folyra is a prescription multivitamin/multimineral dietary supplement indicated for the clinical dietary management of patients with suboptimal nutritional status requiring supplementation of folate and B vitamins, under physician supervision.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20260428"/>
            </section>
